# Web frontend (`src/`)

Relevant role specs: `.claude/agents/frontend-architect.md`, `.claude/agents/frontend-engineer.md`,
`.claude/agents/design-system-manager.md`, `.claude/agents/ui-designer.md`.

- **Reuse `src/components/*` first.** This is the shared design-system library (Button, Card,
  Badge, AssetBadge, StatBlock, GlassCard, IndustryCard, TestimonialCard, StepItem, LogoCloud,
  Accordion, Carousel, Input, Section, SectionHeading, FeatureCard, ArrowLink, Avatar, Logo,
  Reveal) also referenced by the mobile app's temporary RN bridge
  (`mobile/src/theme/primitives/*`) — a change here has a downstream consumer, check
  `mobile.mdc`'s note on that bridge before assuming a component change is web-only.
- **New one-off components need design-system sign-off** — check whether an existing
  component can be extended/composed before adding a new one; this repo has a documented
  house rule against ad-hoc parallel components.
- **Stale note corrected:** this used to say no real product pages existed beyond the marketing
  site. That is no longer true and hasn't been for a few sessions — check `HANDOFF.md` before
  repeating it. Real, live surfaces on `src/` today: the Admin Panel (`/admin/*`, `src/admin/`),
  the Security Company Dashboard (`/security/*`, `src/security/`), a shared privileged layer
  (`src/dashboard/`), and a full customer surface — auth, the `/get-started` onboarding wizard,
  and a post-login customer dashboard at `/dashboard` (`src/customer/`, `src/pages/onboarding/`,
  `src/pages/customer/`). Both dashboards have real customer/admin data blocked behind open
  Stage 8 items (see `security-compliance.mdc`), not behind "doesn't exist yet."
